  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là hoành độ tiếp điểm. \n\t\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy mệnh đề đã cho đúng.</li><li>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có phương trình tiếp tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy mệnh đề đã cho sai.</li><li>Vì tiếp tuyến song song với đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> <br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có phương trình tiếp tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (loại). <br>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>104</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có phương trình tiếp tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>104</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>121</mn><mn>27</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy mệnh đề đã cho đúng.</li><li>Phương trình tiếp tuyến tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> có dạng \n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tTiếp tuyến đi qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo s